title: "Security Compliance Academy — Control Crosswalk Dataset"
abstract: >
  A free, cited control-to-framework crosswalk (ISO/IEC 27001, NIST CSF 2.0,
  SOC 2, CIS Controls, GDPR) with confidence-graded mappings and a
  machine-readable dataset, plus hands-on security-compliance learning content.
type: dataset
